# Breaks this build, and no answer of the hub fixes it: its sign-in to Claude and ChatGPT sends and reads
# `verifier`, `state`, `deviceAuthId` and `userCode`, which a sealed ticket replaced. Everything else of
# the build still works. It goes once app_build_days shows nobody on it: raise MOBILE_IOS_MIN_BUILD to 23,
# then delete the files of this build.
