POST /api/v1/ai-connections/claude/start removed the required property `verifier` from the response with the `200` status
POST /api/v1/ai-connections/codex/poll added the new required request property `ticket`
POST /api/v1/ai-connections/codex/start removed the required property `deviceAuthId` from the response with the `200` status
POST /api/v1/ai-connections/claude/finish removed the request property `state`
POST /api/v1/ai-connections/claude/finish removed the request property `verifier`
